{"id":24,"titleZh":"向老师们致敬","titleEn":"A Tribute to Teachers","date":"1963-11-29","dateZh":"1963 年 11 月 29 日","concepts":"连奏指挥法、指挥经济原则、音乐师承","thesis":"教书是最被低估的崇高职业——一位好老师能用几句点拨点燃热情，也可以用严苛的极简手势教会你倾听与自控。","plain":"新乐季开篇不讲曲式，专讲自己的老师。伯恩斯坦对比两种风格迥异却同样受用一生的师父：库谢维茨基擅长唤醒情绪与热爱，让你主动投入枯燥细节；弗里茨·莱纳则严守“经济原则”，规定每个多余手臂动作都要砍掉，只用最小手势逼出声音。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦现场模仿俄罗斯导师库谢维茨基沙哑深情地打四拍慢板（“重点在两拍之间的连接”），库谢维茨基夫人当场在台下观礼，随后演出当年在老师指导下首次登台指挥的汤普森谐谑曲。","逐一追忆钢琴启蒙海伦·科茨、伊莎贝拉·文格罗娃以及作曲导师皮斯顿，压轴奏响他当年报考莱纳指挥班的试听曲目——勃拉姆斯《学院节日序曲》。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1mp4y1h7Bx","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mp4y1h7Bx","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 教师礼赞","duration":"53:51","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/tribute-to-teachers","repertoire":[{"composer":"Mussorgsky","piece":"Prelude to Khovanshchina","titleZh":"霍万兴那前奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mussorgsky%20Prelude%20to%20Khovanshchina+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mussorgsky%20Prelude%20to%20Khovanshchina"},{"composer":"Randall Thompson","piece":"Symphony No. 2 in E Minor (Scherzo)","titleZh":"第二交响曲谐谑曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/09/b5/ef/09b5ef6d-ab79-cafa-0a80-0dd4a7230ace/mzaf_5992704573037545559.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-2-in-e-minor-1931-ii-largo/351410620?i=351410646&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 2 In e Minor [1931]: II. Largo","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Randall%20Thompson%20Symphony%20No.%202%20in%20E%20Minor+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Randall%20Thompson%20Symphony%20No.%202%20in%20E%20Minor"},{"composer":"Walter Piston","piece":"Suite from The Incr